OL,3,AUK, Canada and Australia condemn Israel
OL,4,Afor refusing criminal probe into aid
OL,5,Aworker killings in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK, Canada and Australia have
OL,8,Fdescribed as "shameful" Israel's
OL,9,Fdecision not to launch a criminal
OL,10,Finvestigation into strikes on a World
OL,11,FCentral Kitchen (WCK) convoy in Gaza in
OL,12,F2024, which killed seven humanitarian
OL,13,Fworkers.
OL,15,FThe victims were three British
OL,16,Fnationals, a Pole, an Australian, a
OL,17,FCanadian and a dual US-Canadian
OL,18,Fcitizen.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31502
